381	 * Function Name         : drvHdcSessionConnect
382	 * Function Description  : Create HDC Session for Host and Device communication
383	 * Input Parameters      : signed int peer_node       The node number of the node where the Device is located.
384	 *                         Currently only 1 node is supported. Remote nodes are not supported. You need
385	 *                         to pass a fixed value of 0
